  <diagram id="page-flow" name="4. Luồng Booking và Payment">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1650" pageHeight="1300" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="d-title" value="Luồng MVP: publish suất chiếu → giữ ghế → booking → payment port/payOS → phát hành vé (Staff check-in là POST_MVP)" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-legend" value="Màu theo service sở hữu bước: &lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;■ Catalog&lt;/font&gt;   &lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;■ Customer qua Gateway&lt;/font&gt;   &lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;■ Booking&lt;/font&gt;   &lt;font color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;■ payOS&lt;/font&gt;   &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;■ Worker&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="45" width="1300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s0" value="&lt;b&gt;0. Admin publish suất chiếu&lt;/b&gt; — POST /api/v1/admin/showtimes/{id}/publish (API-CAT-007). Catalog ghi DB + outbox trong cùng một transaction (state + event atomic)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="85" width="820" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Phát event catalog.showtime.published.v1&lt;/b&gt; (EVT-CAT-001, key showtimeId) → Booking consume (inbox dedup theo eventId) → tạo snapshot showtime_seats trạng thái AVAILABLE. Duplicate ignored; version mới thắng." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="195" width="820" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Customer giữ ghế&lt;/b&gt; — POST /api/v1/showtimes/{id}/holds (API-BKG-001, Idempotency-Key bắt buộc). Booking: SELECT … FOR UPDATE (ORDER BY id chống deadlock) → tất cả ghế phải AVAILABLE → ghế HELD, seat_holds ACTIVE, hết hạn +5 phút. Ghế đã bị giữ → 409 (không lộ thông tin actor khác)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="315" width="820" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Tạo booking từ hold&lt;/b&gt; — POST /api/v1/bookings (API-BKG-002, chỉ hold owner, idempotent). Validate hold ACTIVE + chưa hết hạn (FOR UPDATE); total_amount do server tính; booking PENDING_PAYMENT hết hạn +15 phút; hold → CONVERTED_TO_BOOKING." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="445" width="820" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Khởi tạo thanh toán&lt;/b&gt; — POST /api/v1/bookings/{id}/payments (API-PAY-001, Idempotency-Key, 202). Booking tạo payOS payment link: order_code «UQ», payment_link_id, checkout_url. Outbound call có timeout." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="575" width="820" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s5" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Customer thanh toán trên trang payOS checkout&lt;/b&gt; (ngoài hệ thống)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="695" width="820" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s6" value="&lt;b&gt;6. payOS gửi webhook&lt;/b&gt; — POST /api/v1/webhooks/payments/payos (API-PAY-002). Verify chữ ký raw body + timestamp + đối soát amount / orderCode / paymentLinkId TRƯỚC khi gây effect; idempotent theo provider event ID (đã PAID → trả 200, skip). Mismatch → reject + log." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="795" width="820" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s7" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Transaction xác nhận (atomic trong booking_db):&lt;/b&gt; payments PENDING → PAID → bookings PENDING_PAYMENT → CONFIRMED → showtime_seats HELD → SOLD → INSERT tickets (1 vé/ghế, UQ trên booking_seat_id chặn duplicate) + outbox: payment.succeeded.v1, booking.confirmed.v1. Race 2 webhook: FOR UPDATE trên payments → webhook 2 thấy PAID → skip." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="925" width="820" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s8" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Worker consume&lt;/b&gt; (at-least-once, inbox dedup) → relay/side effect. Duplicate command/event không lặp business effect (BUS-007); một paid booking phát hành tối đa một ticket (BUS-008)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="1065" width="820" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-s9" value="&lt;b&gt;9. Nhận vé (MVP)&lt;/b&gt; — Customer đọc ticket qua API-TKT-001/API-TKT-002..003. Staff lookup/check-in API-TKT-004..006 là POST_MVP; không được thực thi trong MVP." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="1185" width="820" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-br1" value="&lt;b&gt;Nhánh hết hạn hold (5 phút):&lt;/b&gt; Worker/BullMQ delayed job → Booking verify state/version (FOR UPDATE) → seat_holds EXPIRED, ghế HELD → AVAILABLE → emit booking.hold.expired.v1 (EVT-BKG-002). Worker không tự sửa DB." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="315" width="340" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-br2" value="&lt;b&gt;Nhánh hết hạn booking (15 phút):&lt;/b&gt; chưa thanh toán → bookings EXPIRED, payments EXPIRED, release ghế về AVAILABLE. Webhook đến sau khi booking EXPIRED → reject + log warning." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1260" y="575" width="340" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-br3" value="&lt;b&gt;Nhánh hủy suất chiếu:&lt;/b&gt; Catalog emit catalog.showtime.cancelled.v1 (EVT-CAT-002) → Booking áp dụng booking policy cho các booking bị ảnh hưởng; DLQ/replay được audit." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="195" width="300" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-note" value="Cross-cutting: mọi endpoint qua /api/v1 + Bearer (API-COM); event envelope eventId / correlationId / causationId (EVT-COM-001); retry backoff + jitter, poison → DLQ (EVT-COM-004)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="925" width="300" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f0" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s0" target="d-s1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s1" target="d-s2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s2" target="d-s3">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s3" target="d-s4">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s4" target="d-s5">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s5" target="d-s6">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s6" target="d-s7">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s7" target="d-s8">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-f8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s8" target="d-s9">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-fb1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9673a6;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s2" target="d-br1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-fb2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9673a6;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s4" target="d-br2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-fb3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d-s1" target="d-br3">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="page-states" name="5. State machines">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1750" pageHeight="950" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="e-title" value="State machines (docs/database/08-state-machines.md)" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="900" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-h1" value="showtime_seats.status" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-sa" value="AVAILABLE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="150" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-sh" value="HELD" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="340" y="120" width="150" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-ss" value="SOLD" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="340" y="280" width="150" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-sb" value="BLOCKED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="280" width="150" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-se1" value="customer hold ghế" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=1;exitY=0.25;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-sa" target="e-sh">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-se2" value="hết hạn 5 phút / hủy hold" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0;exitY=0.75;entryX=1;entryY=0.75;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-sh" target="e-sa">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-se3" value="payment confirmed" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-sh" target="e-ss">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-se4" value="admin block" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-sa" target="e-sb">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-se5" value="admin unblock" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-sb" target="e-sa">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-h2" value="seat_holds.status" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="620" y="60" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-ha" value="ACTIVE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="640" y="180" width="150" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-he" value="EXPIRED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="920" y="100" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-hc" value="CANCELLED" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="920" y="180" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-hv" value="CONVERTED_TO_BOOKING" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="920" y="260" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-he1" value="timeout 5 phút (job)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-ha" target="e-he">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-he2" value="customer hủy" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-ha" target="e-hc">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-he3" value="tạo booking thành công" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=block;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e-ha" target="e-hv">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-h3" value="bookings.status" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1230" y="60" width="300 " height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e-bp" value="PENDING_PAYMENT" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
